  Cell["Details", "NotesSection"],
  Cell[TextData[{"MomProdHat1[i,j] marks p_i dot p_j when only the first \
momentum is deformed. It keeps that case distinct from a product with both \
momenta shifted."}], "Notes"],
  Cell[TextData[{"These markers are used by ", ButtonBox["ComplexifyMomenta",
      BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData ->
       "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/ComplexifyMomenta"], " and ",
     ButtonBox["ExpandComplexMomenta", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/ExpandComplexMomenta"], ". They \
distinguish which scalar-product factors belong to a deformation."}],
   "Notes"], Cell[TextData[{"The marker is not a prescription for an \
arbitrary shift. Use the supported deformation utilities with consistent \
masses and shift legs."}], "Notes"], Cell["Examples",
   "PrimaryExamplesSection"],
